{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645490/extras/555ffe13e764e8f602ae5dd6bee08997.poster.avif?t=1761385818\" aria-label=\"Combat Gif: &quot;Furniture Fu&quot;\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645490/extras/555ffe13e764e8f602ae5dd6bee08997.webm?t=1761385818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645490/extras/555ffe13e764e8f602ae5dd6bee08997.mp4?t=1761385818\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FURNITURE FU</strong> (affectionately known as Fu Fu) is a casual strategy/action roguelike. A hoard fighting, furniture arranging, gum-chewing, butt-kicking, all-singing, all-dancing ... thing. You must fight ghouls, use their money to buy furniture, which powers you up to fight more ghouls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrange furniture cleverly to power them up. Each furniture affects each other in different ways. so where you place furniture is almost as important as what you place! Taking care with placement gives a huge edge over the course of the run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game divides into placement and combat. Combat rewards reflexes, dodging and timing skills, where the placement rewards strategy and organisation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645490/extras/2ed65ef2f5c3b092456ba7fce8d5e74e.poster.avif?t=1761385818\" aria-label=\"Furnitiure Gif: &quot;Decorate and Destroy&quot;\" width=800 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645490/extras/2ed65ef2f5c3b092456ba7fce8d5e74e.webm?t=1761385818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645490/extras/2ed65ef2f5c3b092456ba7fce8d5e74e.mp4?t=1761385818\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Balance your two inner wolves</strong>: the urge to build beautiful, cosy homes, and the urge to kill everything you see. Build carefully arranged maisonettes, or embrace chaos and play optimally. The world is your oyster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match from a huge range of furniture, from the pretentious chaise longue to the globe to the sofa to the printer to the humble cardboard box. Each placeable has a classic roguelike-style item effect and a unique set of furniture likes and dislikes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645490/extras/6f9011d4806ca1469b6a6f33438350c3.poster.avif?t=1761385818\" aria-label=\"Crack Gif: &quot;Features&quot;\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645490/extras/6f9011d4806ca1469b6a6f33438350c3.webm?t=1761385818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645490/extras/6f9011d4806ca1469b6a6f33438350c3.mp4?t=1761385818\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>200 placeable items</strong> including big floor furniture, knickknacks for the tabletops and stuff to hang on walls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evil looking foes</strong> to provide noble adversaries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Harder enemies over time</strong> that's how games work!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three playable character</strong> to cover all your roleplay needs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenges and stakes</strong> like that other game</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3645490?t=1761385818","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645490/17c7469812cabcf9f943262e2f4a91075ebea89c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761385818","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645490/2d584f24e230693f3002455e72cf28016fd8b1d8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761385818","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645490/2d584f24e230693f3002455e72cf28016fd8b1d8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761385818","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645490/extras/555ffe13e764e8f602ae5dd6bee08997.poster.avif?t=1761385818\" aria-label=\"Combat Gif: &quot;Furniture Fu&quot;\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645490/extras/555ffe13e764e8f602ae5dd6bee08997.webm?t=1761385818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645490/extras/555ffe13e764e8f602ae5dd6bee08997.mp4?t=1761385818\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FURNITURE FU</strong> (affectionately known as Fu Fu) is a casual strategy/action roguelike. A hoard fighting, furniture arranging, gum-chewing, butt-kicking, all-singing, all-dancing ... thing. You must fight ghouls, use their money to buy furniture, which powers you up to fight more ghouls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrange furniture cleverly 